  },
  {
    "id": "purple-plus",
    "name": "Purple Plus Mattress",
    "category": "11-Inch, 2-Inch GelFlex Grid Over Foam, Medium",
    "badge": "Best Pressure Relief",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "pros": [
      "2-inch GelFlex Grid buckles under the shoulder and hip, then springs back",
      "Listed as medium, for back, side and combination sleepers",
      "The open grid does not trap heat the way dense memory foam can",
      "Responsive feel makes changing position easy",
      "Made in the USA, CertiPUR-US and Clean Air GOLD certified, per the listing"
