      "CertiPUR-US certified and fiberglass-free"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Medium-firm, so lighter side sleepers may want a topper",
      "Slower to change position on than a hybrid",
      "One size listing calls it firm; check the label for your size"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The memory foam pick for average-weight side sleepers who share a bed and want a hugging, still feel.",
    "description": "Memory foam is the traditional answer for side sleepers, and the Nectar Classic is one of the most widely bought foam mattresses on Amazon. It is a 12-inch all-foam bed with memory foam comfort layers over a thick support foam and a cooling cover, and Nectar lists it as medium firm. The appeal for side sleepers is the way memory foam responds to heat and pressure. It softens fastest under the shoulder and hip, where pressure is highest, and fills in around the waist, so the body is supported along its full length rather than on a few points. It also absorbs motion very well, which is useful if your partner's movement wakes you. Nectar lists a 365-night trial and its Forever Warranty, and the foams are CertiPUR-US certified and fiberglass-free. The trade-offs are firmness and feel. Medium-firm sits at the firmer end of what most side sleepers want, so a side sleeper under about 130 pounds may not sink in enough and might add a soft topper. Memory foam is also slower to move on, which some combination sleepers dislike. One Amazon size listing labels it firm while others say medium firm, so read the label for the size you order. For side sleepers of average weight who sleep still, it is a sound, well-supported choice."
  },
  {
    "id": "zinus-green-tea-12",
    "name": "Zinus 12 Inch Green Tea Memory Foam Mattress",
    "category": "12-Inch Memory Foam, Green Tea Infused, Budget",
    "badge": "Best Budget",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "pros": [
      "One of the lowest-priced 12-inch memory foam beds on Amazon",
      "Memory foam top layer gives side sleepers some contouring",
      "Green tea infused foam marketed to keep it fresh",
      "CertiPUR-US certified and fiberglass-free, per the listing",
