      "Owners commonly report an odor for the first few days",
      "Not a good match for sleepers over about 230 pounds"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The budget pick for lighter side sleepers, guest rooms and kids' beds.",
    "description": "The Zinus Green Tea mattress has been one of Amazon's best-selling beds for years, and for a side sleeper on a tight budget it is a reasonable choice. It is a 12-inch memory foam mattress with a contouring top layer over support foam, and Zinus infuses the foam with green tea extract, which it markets as keeping the mattress fresh. The Amazon listing for the original model describes a medium-firm feel; Zinus also sells a Cooling gel version and a newer Essential version listed as medium, both of which suit side sleepers too. What the Green Tea does well is give lighter side sleepers enough give at the shoulder and hip for a fraction of the price of the beds above. Owners commonly describe it as cushy and fairly supportive, with good motion control. The listing says the foams are CertiPUR-US certified and fiberglass-free. The trade-offs are the ones you would expect from a budget foam bed. The foams are thinner and lighter than in premium mattresses, so it is unlikely to hold its shape as long, and it is not a match for sleepers over about 230 pounds. Owners commonly report a smell for the first few days after unboxing. For a guest room, a child's bed or a lighter adult on a tight budget, it is good value."
  }
];

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      itemListElement: [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 1,
          name: "Home",
          item: "https://www.thehonestreviewers.com/",
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 2,
          name: "Best Lists",
          item: "https://www.thehonestreviewers.com/best-of/",
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 3,
          name: "Best Mattress for Side Sleepers",
          item: "https://www.thehonestreviewers.com/best-mattress-for-side-sleepers/",
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the best mattress for side sleepers?",
