            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most side sleepers, the best mattress is a medium hybrid with a soft comfort layer and zoned support, such as the Helix Midnight Luxe. It lets the shoulder and hip sink while keeping the waist supported. The Purple Plus suits those with sharp shoulder pressure, and budget shoppers can start with the Zinus Green Tea memory foam mattress."
